[1544.876586, "o", "rafana restart loop,              \r\n           not the consumer offset freeze and processing halt.', 'confidence': 'High'}], 'submission': \"**ROOT CAUSE**\\n\\n-                 \r\n           **Faulty component:** `Pod grafana-7b9cbf56f5-qd4qp` (part of the `grafana` Deployment) in namespace                             \r\n           **astronomy‑shop**  \\n- **Why it fails:** The Grafana container attempts to bind to `0.0.0.0:8080`. Port\\u202f8080 is            \r\n           already in use by multiple other services in the demo (e.g., `checkout`, `cart`, `currency`, etc.). The bind error               \r\n           (`[Errno 98] address in use`) forces Grafana to repeatedly restart, producing connection‑refused errors when it later            \r\n           tries to call its own HTTP API (`localhost:3000`). This is why the pod shows **3 restarts** and why the logs contain             \r\n           repeated `ERROR` and `WARNING` entries about the address conflict and failed HTTP calls.  \\n- **Evidence:**  \\n  -               \r\n           Grafana pod status: `restartCount: 3`, `ready: true` (still running but repeatedly restarted).  \\n  - Logs (last                 \r\n           hour, error‑filtered) contain:  \\n    ```\\n    [Errno 98] error while attempting to bind on address ('0.0.0.0',                  \r\n           8080): address in use\\n    Retry... connection refused to http://localhost:3000/api/admin/provisioning/...\\n    ```              \r\n           \\n  - Other services (checkout, cart, etc.) all expose `containerPort: 8080`, confirming the port conflict.                      \r\n           \\n\\n**FIX**  \\nChange Grafana’s HTTP port to a free value (e.g., the default `3000`) by updating its                             \r\n           Deployment/ConfigMap (or Helm values) to set `GF_SERVER_HTTP_PORT=3000` (or remove any custom port setting). Then                \r\n           redeploy Grafana. This eliminates the bind error, stops the restart loop, and restores the Grafana UI for the                    \r\n           OpenTelemetry demo.\"}, 'TTL': 270.0490655899048, 'phase.fix_kubernetes.duration_s': 3.744,                                       \r\n           'phase.undeploy_leftovers.duration_s': 6.239, 'phase.deploy.duration_s': 928.021, 'phase.inject_fault.duration_s':               \r\n           104.296, 'phase.stage:diagnosis.duration_s': 229.902, 'phase.stage:diagnosis.outcome': 'submitted',                              \r\n           'phase.evaluate:diagnosis.duration_s': 39.248, 'phase.cleanup.duration_s': 210.962, 'run_status': 'complete'}                    \r\n"]
